==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page six of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 6|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|35|notext}} and 25 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

